  "details": "In my environment, I consistently encounter exceptions within the VRCSDK when attempting to upload worlds.\n\nUnity 2022.3.6f1\n\nVRC SDK Base, World: 3.5.0\n\nI did not experience this issue with the following previous versions:\n\nUnity 2019.4.31f1\n\nVRC SDK Base, World: 3.4.2\n\nReproduction Steps:\n\n1. Create a new scene and a new GameObject.\n\n2. Add the VRC Scene Descriptor to the created GameObject.\n\n3. Capture a thumbnail from the Build tab in the VRC SDK Control Panel.\n\n4. Check the Online Publishing and click \"Build and Upload\" button.",
